  <vaem:rationale>The ontology models ODRL policy structures by defining classes for permissions, duties, constraints, rules, and parties, along with properties linking them. Individuals represent specific operators and actions. Subclass and subproperty axioms capture inheritance and nesting relationships as specified in the competency questions.</vaem:rationale>
</prov:Activity>

