  <prov:value>Themis tests: 13/18 CQs pass all their tests. FAILING TESTS:
CQ21:
  hasRequirement domain Requirement -&gt; Absent
CQ24:
  hasPermission domain Permission -&gt; Absent
CQ26:
  hasCondition domain Condition -&gt; Absent
CQ31:
  partOf domain Rule -&gt; Absent
CQ33:
  inheritsFrom domain Policy -&gt; Absent
  inheritsFrom range Policy -&gt; Absent
Fix each failing test in the ontology: Undefined = add the term under exactly that name; Incorrect = declare it with the right type; Absent = add the tested axiom so the knowledge is modelled; Conflict = the ontology contradicts the test, correct the axioms.</prov:value>
</earl:TestResult>

